{"title":"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 9b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/a/81a1fbb8951975f2af152b5c26c760e5adc0cfdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a,b) = \\dfrac{a}{b} + \\dfrac{b}{a} + \\dfrac{1}{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"170\" height=\"39\" />. For example, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eedb031d99fdbc698f81eeb1dd3a9c5806f18e90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/2/c92345decb66eeb7614870acf1ca1b17b219857d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a,a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> is an integer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the definition of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/189a3f8380b67b3632c243ee7c4f31e40e485a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a, b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1c25f49a9064c516521fef41d94411db581f267.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a, a) = \\frac{a}{a} + \\frac{a}{a} + \\frac{1}{a \\times a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"195\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f53070c195da5a5024f59112838aeecef462adfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1 + 1 + \\frac{1}{a^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4e4b1c84d1b61e9f3a095ca629bd00f0195ab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 + \\frac{1}{a^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4f4b1a6af97e237962d9e60e202c6a38a9e015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{a^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"38\" /> must be an integer for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97c96b3a2aa491f91e0bff2a5a618cb67f7b3990.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a, a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> to be an integer. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373f3e9c1a9cba15c65e133604eb42156015afe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2}$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> must be a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The only factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac95820f1dfafeebe2a6475aef9e65fe1a50e8d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/c/6ccced94f4d608452b5bc8425e8d6b3df318c1c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\pm \\sqrt{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/3/b43ba1f77810a10b7b09b67669c0b6b15223ca14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive integer, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3eee5bb894c76f73895b303b2518013e27a031a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"25\" />, which is the only positive integer that works.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011017\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 83/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 313/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4146/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.138      1 2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_9\n100.00%    7.138      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36004:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018011017 and revision id 279857. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}